window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Under the oppressive rule of a tyrant king, twenty-four-year-old Dani has built a life of quiet defiance in the town of Langes. When the monstrous draugr begin to ravage the countryside, Dani refuses to bow to the crown's neglect. Rallying a militia of fearless women, she becomes the shield her people desperately need.</p> <p>Beneath Dani's unwavering resolve lies a fractured soul. Wounds she has long buried resurface, and a rage she cannot contain begins to burn anew. Drawn toward a destiny that has lingered in the shadows, Dani must confront the truth of who she is and the power that has always been her burden. As divine forces and devastating revelations close in, she faces a battle that demands more than courage.</p> <p>In a world teetering on the edge of ruin, her story is one of fierce resilience, unbreakable loyalty, and the relentless fight to rise above the darkness threatening to consume her.</p>"; 
